    "lineage": "",
    "mech_note": "Last Epoch Skeleton Necromancer: skeletal warriors, mages, and Death Knight (via the Exsanguinous passive or Skeleton Warrior Mage upgrades) deployed as a sustained army. Rogue of the Dead passive tree node upgrades warriors into aggressive flankers; Dread Shade aura buffs the whole army. The Necromancer commands the army with Transplant (movement + skeleton-seed on landing) and Bone Curse (debuff amplifier). Army stance is Aggressive by default — skeletons charge nearest target. LE's minion system allows per-skeleton-type specialization via upgrade nodes: fully investing warriors vs mages vs archers produces distinct army compositions. A beginner-friendly default for the Necromancer class, holding upper B-tier even without optimal uniques, making it one of the game's most recommended starter builds.",
